From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 175] panvk: write structured texel-buffer descriptors in vkGetDescriptorEXT
Generated-by: LLM

vkGetDescriptorEXT wrote uniform/storage texel-buffer descriptors as a
plain BUFFER (address and size only), while a VkBufferView of the same
buffer gets a STRUCTURE buffer with the element stride and the format
conversion. Shaders fetching through a descriptor-buffer texel buffer
(D3D12 typed buffers under VKD3D-Proton) therefore read without format
or stride. Build the descriptor with pan_buffer_texture_emit(), as
CreateBufferView does. biblioklept

Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC2 (OPPO CPH2763, MT6878)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Dependencies: csf-v11/174

